.SH "Detailed Description"
.PP 

.SS "template<uint32_t dim>
.br
class csmp::FlatBoundaryStressVisitor< dim >"/ This visitor is to apply forces on flat boundary faces\&. / It accesses a flat face and computes the nodal forces based on the normal and shear stresses defined in the config file\&. 
